# OpenMAO local runtime and private workspace records
#
# The governance layer is public as of 2026-07-25 (ADR-0006 Option A): docs/adr/, DECISIONS.md,
# STATUS.md, and redacted audit records are tracked. What stays here is private for privacy or
# operational reasons — third-party correspondence, session transcripts, working plans — never
# because it is unflattering.
/.openmao/
/BUILD_PLAN.md
/MODULE_OWNERSHIP.md
/WORK_BREAKDOWN.md
/decisions/
/internal/
/sessions/
/docs/research/
/docs/sessions/
/docs/audit-trails/
/docs/runbooks/
/docs/SESSION_PROTOCOL.md
/docs/evidence/

# Audit records are private by default; a redacted `*-public-record.md` is published instead.
/docs/audits/*
!/docs/audits/*-public-record.md
/docs/templates/APPROVAL_PACKET_TEMPLATE.md
/docs/templates/AUDIT_REPORT_TEMPLATE.md
/docs/templates/SESSION_TEMPLATE.md
/docs/templates/SIGNOFF_LOG_TEMPLATE.md

